.Dd October 13, 2026
.Dt TOYBOX 7
.Os ABSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm toybox
.Nd source and license of the bounded diff and hexdump ports
.Sh DESCRIPTION
ABSD adapts the pending diff and hexdump implementations from Toybox 0.8.15.
This does not install the Toybox multicall program or imply full upstream
option compatibility. Individual manual pages describe each admitted contract.
Diff retains its upstream 2014 author notices; hexdump is Copyright 2021
Moritz Roehrich. Exact archive, member and patch identities live in the source
repository userland/diff and userland/hexdump SOURCE.json records.
